00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.870
I gave you money every month to give to Cal.

2
00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.870
You literally told me not to give him too much at once

3
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.870
because you were afraid he'd blow it all.

4
00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.870
Was I wrong?

5
00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:12.870
A man with no income shouldn't get that much cash at once.

6
00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:16.370
